    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> STAT_U06_L06_Q01</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.STAT.DMC.2</p><p>A strategy has 0.80 probability of gaining $5 and 0.20 probability of losing $10. What is its expected value?</p><p><img src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/STAT_U06_L06_Q01_visual.png" alt="Statistics visual supports graph, table, distribution, or data-display interpretation without adding new assessment facts." style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /></p>]]></text>
